          "claim": "提出了一种新的图表示学习模型——GSAERU，用于大规模时序图数据上的节点表征学习。",
          "claim_en": "Proposed a new graph representation learning model - GSAERU, for node representation learning on large-scale sequential graphs.",
          "technical_features": [
            "通过引入图摘要技术将原图映射到固定规模的新图中，解决了GNN模型输出无法直接输入到RNN模型中进行训练的问题。",
            "利用图摘要技术加速模型训练和减少模型占用的计算资源。"
          ],
          "technical_features_en": [
            "By introducing graph summarization technology to map the original graph to a fixed-size new graph, solving the problem that the output of the GNN model cannot be directly input into the RNN model for training.",
