        "original": {
          "point_id": "2",
          "claim": "提出了一种新的基于图摘要的分布式图神经网络训练框架，称为DSGNN，用于分布式场景下的基于图神经网络的图表示学习。",
          "claim_en": "Proposed a new distributed graph neural network training framework based on graph summarization, called DSGNN, for graph representation learning based on graph neural networks in distributed scenarios.",
          "technical_features": [
            "可以在工作节点上对子图进行小批量样本的学习，而不是让领导节点完成子图生成。",
            "使用图摘要技术生成的子图规模远远小于原图，在其基础上进行模型训练可以大大提升效率。"
          ],
          "technical_features_en": [
            "Can perform mini-batch sample learning on subgraphs at worker nodes instead of having the leader node complete subgraph generation.",
            "The subgraphs generated using graph summarization technology have a much smaller scale than the original graph, allowing for efficient model training based on them."
